00:41:52,579 --> 00:41:57,579
赤く赤く爆ぜてくよ
Bursting, bursting into crimson

465
00:41:57,679 --> 00:41:59,179
ねぇ
Hey...

466
00:41:59,279 --> 00:42:01,479
Tu sei senza peccato?
Are you without sin?

467
00:42:01,579 --> 00:42:05,279
Quanto sarà pesante il mio castigo?
How heavy will my punishment be?

468
00:42:05,479 --> 00:42:17,279
Ti accorgi delle voci senza voce?
Do you notice the voiceless voices?

469
00:42:17,879 --> 00:42:24,679
Ti accorgi dei tuoi peccati?
Do you realize your sins?

470
00:42:24,879 --> 00:42:31,079
癒えない傷口は 紅の薔薇のように
An unhealing wound, like a crimson rose,

471
00:42:31,279 --> 00:42:37,479
憎しみ宿る心に花開く
Blooms within a heart where hatred dwells

472
