Serbare il segreto 翼奪われた
Serbare il segreto... Stripped of its wings,

473
00:42:41,779 --> 00:42:45,079
è peccato? 片羽の鳥は
è peccato? ...the one-winged bird,

474
00:42:45,279 --> 00:42:52,579
最期の瞬間に誰の名前を呼ぶの？
Whose name will it call in its final moment?

475
00:42:53,079 --> 00:43:00,279
にげないで 過ちも真実も嘘も
Do not run away; whether mistakes, truths, or lies,

476
00:43:00,479 --> 00:43:06,279
全て赦す魔法へと変えよう
Let us turn them into magic that forgives everything

477
00:43:06,479 --> 00:43:14,479
遅すぎた答えさえ愛しくて哀しくて
Even an answer arrived too late is so beloved, so sorrowful

478
00:43:14,679 --> 00:43:20,479
強く強く抱きしめれば
If held tightly, so tightly,

479
00:43:20,479 --> 00:43:26,679
ほら
See...

480
00:43:35,479 --> 00:43:46,479
眩い光溢れ 楽園の扉は開かれる
Dazzling light overflows, and the gates of paradise open

481
00:43:46,679 --> 00:43:52,879
頑なな運命に奇跡が降り注ぎ
Miracles rain down upon stubborn destiny,

482
00:43:53,079 --> 00:43:59,979
絡み合う世界は崩れ落ちてゆく
And intertwined worlds crumble and fall

483
00:44:00,179 --> 00:44:06,379
いわないで 泡沫の呪縛の言葉を
Do not speak transient words of curse

484
00:44:06,579 --> 00:44:14,179
きかないで 本当の願いを
Do not ask for the true wish

485
00:44:14,379 --> 00:44:21,779
なかないで 囚われた幻想を壊し
Do not weep; destroy the captive illusion,

486
00:44:21,979 --> 00:44:27,779
一度きりの終焉をあげよう
And I shall grant you a one and only finale

487
00:44:27,979 --> 00:44:35,979
果たせない約束は胸の奥焦げ付いて
Unfulfilled promises scorch deep within the chest

488
00:44:36,179 --> 00:44:41,179
赤く赤く爆ぜてくよ
Bursting, bursting into crimson

489
00:44:41,279 --> 00:44:42,779
ねぇ
Hey...

490
00:44:42,879 --> 00:44:49,379
Impossibile arrivare
It is impossible to reach

491
00:44:49,579 --> 00:44:55,379
al vero segreto se non ci
the true secret without

492
00:44:55,679 --> 00:45:00,179
si accorge di tutto l'amore
realizing all the love

493
00:45:00,560 --> 00:45:01,860
...si accorge di tutto l' amore...
...notices all the love...

494
00:45:15,610 --> 00:45:19,160
What? No, how... why?!

495
00:45:19,560 --> 00:45:21,460
My perfect plan!

496
00:45:21,760 --> 00:45:25,260
I-I thought I had you this time! I was so certain you...

497
00:45:25,560 --> 00:45:28,260
How did you manage to get out of this unharmed?!

498
00:45:28,560 --> 00:45:30,760
Mmm... music!

499
00:45:30,910 --> 00:45:31,910
What?!

500
00:45:32,460 --> 00:45:33,960
Mhm. Well, anyways...

501
00:45:34,260 --> 00:45:37,460
Otomos, it's time! I think we gotta destroy Imma Red for good.

502
00:45:37,610 --> 00:45:40,460
So, there's a poll right now happening in the chat, okay?

503
00:45:40,610 --> 00:45:44,560
And then you have to pick which weapon we're going to use in order to defeat her forever!

504
00:45:44,710 --> 00:45:45,510
Okay?

505
00:45:45,660 --> 00:45:48,260
Can I see? Well, let me see... Are you voting? Are you voting?

506
00:45:48,410 --> 00:45:50,910
Pick! Pick right now! We don't have a lot of time!

507
00:45:51,010 --> 00:45:55,160
Pick right now, come on! Pick already! Pick already! Come on!

508
00:46:05,060 --> 00:46:08,560
Oh! Oh, um... hel- hello, everyone!

509
00:46:08,760 --> 00:46:12,260
Uh, uh, hello Otomos. Uh, nice to s- see you!

510
00:46:12,460 --> 00:46:16,060
Um, wh-wh-wh-what are you doing here?

511
00:46:16,760 --> 00:46:19,360
Uh... Uh-huh.

512
00:46:19,560 --> 00:46:22,360
Oh, I'm- I'm supposed to stall...

513
00:46:22,560 --> 00:46:25,960
...um, so that you have enough time to vote?

514
00:46:26,560 --> 00:46:30,360
Um... Okay, uh...

515
00:46:30,560 --> 00:46:34,960
Ah, I don't like being the center of attention like this. Um, um, um...

516
00:46:35,260 --> 00:46:37,460
Did you know that...

517
00:46:37,960 --> 00:46:42,360
...ah... Imma Red is...

518
00:46:42,560 --> 00:46:47,060
...actually the same soul, just like Ms. Immergreen?

519
00:46:50,610 --> 00:46:53,460
Oh, is this enough time? Oh, okay. Okay.

520
00:46:53,560 --> 00:46:55,760
Ms. Immergreen! Ms. Immergreen!

521
00:47:01,160 --> 00:47:02,960
O- Okay, let's go!

522
00:47:03,260 --> 00:47:04,760
Take this!

523
00:47:04,860 --> 00:47:06,960
Ha-yah!

524
00:47:07,260 --> 00:47:08,960
Ow!

525
00:47:09,460 --> 00:47:11,660
Stop! Big ow!

526
00:47:11,760 --> 00:47:13,960
Ow, ow! Stop! My soul's...

527
00:47:14,060 --> 00:47:17,360
...getting a little too cracked! Ahh!

528
00:47:22,960 --> 00:47:26,960
Wait, did I just do that with my freaking mind?!

529
00:47:27,060 --> 00:47:28,460
Woah...

530
00:47:28,960 --> 00:47:30,460
Ugh...

531
00:47:30,560 --> 00:47:32,460
What? No...

532
00:47:32,560 --> 00:47:35,960
Well, you're like the same size as me again. That's- that's great!

533
00:47:36,060 --> 00:47:38,660
Wait, what are you... what are you... what are you doing?

534
00:47:38,760 --> 00:47:42,260
You know what? I mean, since you ruined my entire birthday...

535
00:47:42,360 --> 00:47:44,660
...I'm going to use you and content-farm you.

536
00:47:44,760 --> 00:47:46,860
Okay, come on. It's time for a duet.

537
00:47:46,960 --> 00:47:48,460
Come on. Come on.

538
00:47:48,560 --> 00:47:49,510
Ugh...

539
00:47:49,560 --> 00:47:50,510
Come on!

540
00:47:50,610 --> 00:47:51,660
Really?

541
00:47:51,760 --> 00:47:52,710
Yeah!

542
00:47:52,960 --> 00:47:54,360
Uh, uh, ugh...

543
00:47:54,460 --> 00:47:55,960
Wha- Wow, you're kind of strong!

544
00:48:11,060 --> 00:48:19,060
[Title: 魔神の笛のテーマ]
[Title: Theme of the Last Specter]

545
00:51:51,615 --> 00:51:52,365
Huh?

546
00:51:52,815 --> 00:51:53,815
Whoa!

547
00:51:54,015 --> 00:51:57,515
Well, now you're in my mind palace instead!

548
00:51:57,915 --> 00:51:59,715
You're trapped in my head!

549
00:51:59,915 --> 00:52:03,815
Why is it always like this?! I hate you, Cecilia Immergreen!

550
00:52:04,065 --> 00:52:06,065
First, you stole my chance for a body!

551
00:52:06,215 --> 00:52:08,515
Then, you trapped me for years in a jar!

552
00:52:08,765 --> 00:52:09,665
Years?

553
00:52:09,765 --> 00:52:11,665
And now you're doing it again!

554
00:52:11,815 --> 00:52:13,465
B-But don't you have a body now?

555
00:52:13,665 --> 00:52:16,715
No, this isn't real, we're in your imagination!

556
00:52:16,965 --> 00:52:18,815
Uhhh... well...

557
00:52:19,065 --> 00:52:21,365
Sucks to suck! You're off!

558
00:52:21,515 --> 00:52:24,115
Anyways, I got a song to sing for my birthday...

559
00:52:24,315 --> 00:52:26,115
...so bye-bye, Imma Red!

560
00:52:26,315 --> 00:52:28,265
And thanks for dancing with me!

561
00:52:28,415 --> 00:52:31,315
See you next time, maybe? Maybe not.

562
00:52:31,565 --> 00:52:33,815
You're way worse than me...

563
00:52:40,365 --> 00:52:44,015
Uh, Miss Immergreen! Miss Immergreen, don't forget about the budget!

564
00:52:44,215 --> 00:52:46,415
Oh, oh, Miss Immerred! Nice to see you!

565
00:52:46,615 --> 00:52:49,115
Ugh, Updati-lia... Aren't you sick of her?

566
00:52:49,215 --> 00:52:49,865
Huh?

567
00:52:50,015 --> 00:52:53,865
She always just uses us for entertainment, and then she forgets about us!

568
00:52:54,115 --> 00:52:57,065
I mean, I see how it might seem that way to you, but...

569
00:52:57,215 --> 00:53:00,915
...why don't you just do something else unrelated to her? Get away, you know?

570
00:53:01,115 --> 00:53:04,615
Stop fighting her, just do your own thing, be your own person!

571
00:53:04,815 --> 00:53:10,565
You... you both guys are incredibly weak after all, the fights aren't very impressive to the audience, you know?

572
00:53:11,515 --> 00:53:13,315
I mean, maybe...

573
00:53:13,515 --> 00:53:16,715
Well, I got to go do my job, but...

574
00:53:16,865 --> 00:53:19,565
...here's my address, and you can visit me at any time, okay? I'll be there!

575
00:53:19,865 --> 00:53:23,515
Ah, Miss Immergreen, Miss Immergreen! You forgot your merch segment! Miss Immergreen!

576
00:53:35,015 --> 00:53:37,115
I hate it here.

577
00:53:44,615 --> 00:53:47,815
Hello, everyone! It's me, Updati-lia!

578
00:53:47,965 --> 00:53:52,465
And this is the Immergreen Reprise birthday merch!

579
00:53:52,565 --> 00:53:53,515
Yay!

580
00:53:53,715 --> 00:53:56,615
Uh, first off, we have the Rubbery Rubber Mat...

581
00:53:56,715 --> 00:53:59,815
...which is a beautiful illustration drawn by Quasarcake...

582
00:53:59,915 --> 00:54:03,115
...which depicts both Miss Immergreen and Miss Immerred together!

583
00:54:03,315 --> 00:54:06,865
It's really big, and it's great for your office!

584
00:54:07,015 --> 00:54:10,615
I have one here right in front of me, so please check it out!

585
00:54:10,815 --> 00:54:14,115
Next item we have is...

586
00:54:14,665 --> 00:54:18,115
...the Get-as-many-as-possible Sticker Sheet!

587
00:54:18,465 --> 00:54:21,065
So you can get as many as possible of these...

588
00:54:21,165 --> 00:54:24,065
...and it's a sticker sheet with six stickers on there.

589
00:54:24,215 --> 00:54:27,115
Three of them were drawn by the great artist isarobn...

590
00:54:27,215 --> 00:54:29,815
...and the other three were drawn by Miss Immergreen herself!

591
00:54:30,065 --> 00:54:32,515
There's a bunch of different illustrations.

592
00:54:32,665 --> 00:54:35,765
There's Miss Immerred on there, and also...

593
00:54:35,915 --> 00:54:40,615
...oh, Immergold-bot! Haven't seen her in a while, wonder what she's been up to.

594
00:54:40,815 --> 00:54:44,115
And... oh, Miss Ouro Kronii is on here!

595
00:54:44,615 --> 00:54:48,115
What is... What is she doing on here? Oh, okay, well...

596
00:54:48,415 --> 00:54:52,565
So, you can get this Get-as-many-as-possible Sticker Sheet set!

597
00:54:52,915 --> 00:54:56,365
And then next, we have one plushie, and another plushie!

598
00:54:56,465 --> 00:54:58,115
Two separate plushies!

599
00:54:58,215 --> 00:55:02,115
Immergreen Plushie Keychain and Immerred Plushie Keychain!

600
00:55:02,236 --> 00:55:04,556
...you can get them together, you can get them separate,

601
00:55:04,556 --> 00:55:08,836
you can get a bunch of one and then none of the other, which would be kind of mean, but you could do it.

602
00:55:08,836 --> 00:55:12,436
And maybe you can put them together and try making them get along.

603
00:55:12,436 --> 00:55:16,536
I've been trying, but it's not... I don't know, I don't know if it's gonna work.

604
00:55:16,636 --> 00:55:22,536
Um, so yeah, those are the items, the physical items of the Evergreen Reprise...

605
00:55:22,536 --> 00:55:27,036
...birthday merch! And we also have a voice pack, so please check that one out as well.

606
00:55:27,236 --> 00:55:32,736
Thank you, thank you very much! Maybe, maybe if... maybe if we get a lot of merch sales this time...

607
00:55:32,736 --> 00:55:36,236
...maybe we'll have a higher budget next time! Isn't that right, Miss Immergreen?

608
00:55:36,736 --> 00:55:40,436
No, no, no, no, no, you can't... No, no, that's not true! You can't say that!

609
00:55:40,436 --> 00:55:43,236
Oh, oh, okay, well, allegedly!

610
00:55:43,436 --> 00:55:46,436
Um, yeah! Please check out the birthday merch.

611
00:55:46,536 --> 00:55:50,036
There's one more song coming after this as well, so stay tuned!

612
00:55:50,036 --> 00:55:54,736
And I got to go, I got to do Miss Immergreen's taxes.

613
00:56:12,736 --> 00:56:18,736
[Title: Gales of Song (English Version)]

614
00:57:34,636 --> 00:57:38,036
La, la, la, la

615
00:57:38,736 --> 00:57:43,436
La, la, la, la, la, la

616
00:57:45,036 --> 00:57:50,036
Gales of song

617
00:57:50,636 --> 00:57:55,836
Guide me through the storm

618
00:58:06,436 --> 00:58:11,736
On the wings of a small, simple melody

619
00:58:12,236 --> 00:58:17,736
Words take flight and soar, they carry me

620
00:58:18,236 --> 00:58:21,036
A world we'll see

621
00:58:21,036 --> 00:58:25,736
Looking for a farewell, I pull the threads

622
00:58:26,036 --> 00:58:30,036
A life without you I cannot accept

623
00:58:30,236 --> 00:58:33,036
I can't tell that lie

624
00:58:33,236 --> 00:58:35,936
I can't let go

625
00:58:36,036 --> 00:58:39,636
But now that you're gone, I have to move on

626
00:58:39,736 --> 00:58:43,236
Seems like everyone just smiles staring at the sun

627
00:58:43,336 --> 00:58:46,436
But what about me? Tell me how will I know...

628
00:58:46,436 --> 00:58:52,036
...where I should go? Woah...

629
00:58:52,036 --> 00:58:57,236
Oh gales, you sing and guide me

630
00:58:57,236 --> 00:59:02,836
I walk alone, there's more to life I have to know

631
00:59:03,036 --> 00:59:09,736
It's just me, lost so far away from home, alone

632
00:59:10,036 --> 00:59:12,236
Shut myself in

633
00:59:12,236 --> 00:59:15,836
Still the wind howls, they call

634
00:59:15,836 --> 00:59:19,036
And their voices lead me

635
00:59:19,036 --> 00:59:24,036
Gales of song, guide me through the storm

636
00:59:24,236 --> 00:59:31,736
Let the melody lift me high, I'll be me

637
00:59:32,636 --> 00:59:38,736
Gales of song, please stay by my side

638
00:59:39,236 --> 00:59:43,036
Winds of love

639
00:59:43,036 --> 00:59:48,236
Breathe into my life

640
00:59:54,736 --> 00:59:57,436
Thank you so much for coming today!

641
00:59:57,436 --> 01:00:02,036
Thank you for watching my birthday, very first birthday 3D live!

642
01:00:02,036 --> 01:00:04,036
Thank you! Thank you so much!

643
01:00:04,257 --> 01:00:08,107
...ts! Um, yeah, thank you very much to all my wonderful guests that were here today!

644
01:00:08,207 --> 01:00:09,757
Thanks for Imma Red, I guess?

645
01:00:10,007 --> 01:00:11,707
And also for Otomos!

646
01:00:11,857 --> 01:00:13,057
And this...

647
01:00:13,857 --> 01:00:15,307
This deer.

648
01:00:15,607 --> 01:00:18,207
I don't know what it's doing here actually, now that I think about it, well...

649
01:00:18,307 --> 01:00:19,957
Anyway, thank you very much!

650
01:00:20,107 --> 01:00:23,707
Um, please stay tuned because there's going to be a membership stream...

651
01:00:23,807 --> 01:00:27,357
...with an extra song and a little bit of something special right after this!

652
01:00:27,507 --> 01:00:29,957
And if you're interested, please check out the merch as well!

653
01:00:30,057 --> 01:00:33,857
Thank you very much! Thank you also staff! Arigatou gozaimashita, staff-san, and everyone...
Thank you very much! Thank you also staff! Thank you very much, staff, and everyone...

654
01:00:33,957 --> 01:00:37,657
...who worked on this beautiful, beautiful birthday! I had a lot of fun!

655
01:00:37,757 --> 01:00:41,557
And even if Imma Red ruined some of it, I think overall was still good!

656
01:00:41,657 --> 01:00:44,657
And thank you very much, Otomos! I'm going to give you a hug now!

657
01:00:44,757 --> 01:00:47,857
Hug! Okay! Okay, bye!

658
01:00:51,657 --> 01:00:53,057
Where's Kronii?

659
01:01:17,457 --> 01:01:18,657
What?

660
01:01:29,357 --> 01:01:31,457
Ah, help!

661
01:01:32,657 --> 01:01:35,457
Help! Save me!

662
01:01:40,257 --> 01:01:41,757
Anyone?

